# An application of an abstract object, which returns its argument through φ.
#
#   ⟦ bar ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ∅, φ ↦ ξ.x ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.bar(x ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧) ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.169.

F c0 bar foo
F c1 x φ
D c2 c1 x
P c1 φ c2
P c0 bar c1
D c3 c0 bar
F c4
Δ c4 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
A c5 c3 x c4
P c0 foo c5
